{"3519540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ゴールド漁師 (金條釣手)", "steam_appid": 3519540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Japanese-style &quot;medal game&quot; arcade machine, where you’ll help the VTuber Omaimaimaii fish up gold bars from the ocean!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What? You’re asking why there are gold bars in the ocean? That’s the Lee family’s secret — no way we’re telling you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Torture Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the fishing rod and carefully hook up the gold bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid attacks from sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing gold bars into the water has completely destroyed the homes of the sea creatures. Maybe it was just an unintentional accident caused by the Lee Corporation, but the evil sea creatures just can’t learn to forgive. They’ll stop at nothing to disrupt your gold bar transport operation in protest — how unreasonable! We strongly condemn the violent acts of these aquatic thugs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transporting Gold Bars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fishing rod to deliver the gold bars brought up by underwater drones to the transport vehicle on the other side. But be careful — the fishing line is very fragile!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Your Transport Mission!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the required number of gold bars to earn token rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t Lose All Your Tokens!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of tokens, well… good luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Japanese-style &quot;medal game&quot; arcade machine, where you’ll help the VTuber Omaimaimaii fish up gold bars from the ocean!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What? You’re asking why there are gold bars in the ocean? That’s the Lee family’s secret — no way we’re telling you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Torture Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the fishing rod and carefully hook up the gold bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid attacks from sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing gold bars into the water has completely destroyed the homes of the sea creatures. Maybe it was just an unintentional accident caused by the Lee Corporation, but the evil sea creatures just can’t learn to forgive. They’ll stop at nothing to disrupt your gold bar transport operation in protest — how unreasonable! We strongly condemn the violent acts of these aquatic thugs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transporting Gold Bars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fishing rod to deliver the gold bars brought up by underwater drones to the transport vehicle on the other side. But be careful — the fishing line is very fragile!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Your Transport Mission!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the required number of gold bars to earn token rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t Lose All Your Tokens!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of tokens, well… good luck.</p>", "short_description": "Follow VTUBER Omaimaimaii and pick up the fishing rod! Hook up the gold bars! Defend against the shameless marine creatures", "supported_languages": "Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519540/92525e74d6a95ae6eb60c8a527384f81720dbdf6/header.jpg?t=1743510521", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519540/01f09ee4325e876f8eb5383537c91db98e1d65c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743510521", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519540/01f09ee4325e876f8eb5383537c91db98e1d65c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743510521", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</stro